     "wrestler"
    ],
    "grade": "presumed",
    "source": "BCW's own News page (promotions/bcw-newa/archive/news.html), Title History page (promotions/bcw-newa/archive/title-history.html), and 4 April 1999 card (promotions/bcw-newa/archive/1999-04-04.html)",
    "note": "Beat Angus the Destroyer by pinfall (flap-jack, piledriver, and the Gator Bite, 15:12) on BCW's own 4 April 1999 card — the same finisher credited to this John Cole matches this character's own aka and finisher exactly, now served (promotions/bcw-newa/archive/1999-04-04.html). Beat Brent Morris for the BCW London Territorial Championship, then lost it to Scott Simpson in Canada, per BCW's own 24 June 1999 news post, which places the loss \"a mere two days before Cole would go on to beat Adam Feirce for the [NeWA] Canadian strap.\""
   }
  ],
  "type": "character"
